 },
 {
  "start": 54.470907,
  "end": 56.87458,
  "sil_before": [
   44.601224,
   54.470907
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   56.87458,
   67.727914
  ],
  "i": 11,
  "text": "But 10 was never the finish line."
 },
 {
  "start": 67.727914,
  "end": 70.367619,
  "sil_before": [
   56.87458,
   67.727914
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   70.367619,
   70.745125
  ],
  "i": 12,
  "text": "Because the next jump on Casper's Roadmap"
 },
 {
  "start": 70.745125,
  "end": 72.786417,
  "sil_before": [
   70.367619,
   70.745125
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   72.786417,
   73.161837
  ],
  "i": 13,
  "text": "takes those 10 blocks a second."
 },
 {
  "start": 73.161837,
  "end": 75.095057,
  "sil_before": [
   72.786417,
   73.161837
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   75.095057,
   75.743197
  ],
  "i": 14,
  "text": "and pushes them up to 40."
 },
 {
  "start": 75.743197,
  "end": 78.277256,
  "sil_before": [
   75.095057,
   75.743197
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   78.277256,
   92.915578
  ],
  "i": 15,
  "text": "targeted before the end of this year."
 },
 {
  "start": 102.509388,
  "end": 108.417347,
  "sil_before": [
   93.026712,
   102.509388
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   108.417347,
   129.694422
  ],
  "i": 16,
  "text": "And the tech that makes all that possible is one of the most amazing achievements in all of crypto."
 },
 {
  "start": 129.694422,
  "end": 130.549206,
  "sil_before": [
   108.417347,
   129.694422
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   130.549206,
   131.417166
  ],
  "i": 17,
  "text": "But here's the thing."
 },
 {
  "start": 131.417166,
  "end": 135.182698,
  "sil_before": [
   130.549206,
   131.417166
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   135.182698,
   143.735896
  ],
  "i": 18,
  "text": "You don't just quadruple the speed of the fastest chain in Proof of Work."
 },
 {
  "start": 143.735896,
  "end": 146.47322,
  "sil_before": [
   135.182698,
   143.735896
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   146.47322,
   146.920658
  ],
  "i": 19,
  "text": "At this level, there's no dial to turn."
 },
 {
  "start": 146.920658,
  "end": 149.875918,
  "sil_before": [
   146.47322,
   146.920658
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   149.875918,
   157.478299
  ],
  "i": 20,
  "text": "Something at the very core of Casper has to change."
 },
 {
  "start": 157.478299,
  "end": 161.162222,
  "sil_before": [
   149.875918,
   157.478299
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   161.162222,
   172.17449
  ],
  "i": 21,
  "text": "So let's get into all of this and I'm going to show you some of the coolest things ever."
 },
 {
  "start": 180.14932,
  "end": 185.012766,
  "sil_before": [
   172.271134,
   180.14932
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   185.012766,
   189.856803
  ],
  "i": 22,
  "text": "So Casper's story is like a ladder, and every rung on it is a heart fork."
 },
 {
  "start": 189.856803,
  "end": 190.575601,
  "sil_before": [
   185.012766,
   189.856803
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   190.575601,
   191.119297
  ],
  "i": 23,
  "text": "Wrong one."
 },
 {
  "start": 191.119297,
  "end": 191.790249,
  "sil_before": [
   190.575601,
   191.119297
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   191.790249,
   195.16415
  ],
  "i": 24,
  "text": "Crescendo."
 },
 {
  "start": 195.16415,
  "end": 196.622676,
  "sil_before": [
   191.790249,
   195.16415
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   196.622676,
   196.92839
  ],
  "i": 25,
  "text": "May 2025."
 },
 {
  "start": 196.92839,
  "end": 198.139501,
  "sil_before": [
   196.622676,
   196.92839
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   198.139501,
   198.685102
  ],
  "i": 26,
  "text": "over a year ago now."
 },
 {
  "start": 198.685102,
  "end": 202.284989,
  "sil_before": [
   198.139501,
   198.685102
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   202.284989,
   203.49322
  ],
  "i": 27,
  "text": "They took Casper for one block a second to ten blocks a second."
 },
 {
  "start": 203.49322,
  "end": 206.410816,
  "sil_before": [
   202.284989,
   203.49322
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   206.410816,
   208.365351
  ],
  "i": 28,
  "text": "One block every hundred milliseconds."
 },
 {
  "start": 208.365351,
  "end": 210.373039,
  "sil_before": [
   206.410816,
   208.365351
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   210.373039,
   212.508209
  ],
  "i": 29,
  "text": "So that's live running right now."
 },
 {
  "start": 212.508209,
  "end": 213.175329,
  "sil_before": [
   210.373039,
   212.508209
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   213.175329,
   213.853923
  ],
  "i": 30,
  "text": "Wrong two."
 },
 {
  "start": 213.853923,
  "end": 214.481927,
  "sil_before": [
   213.175329,
   213.853923
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   214.481927,
   217.940771
  ],
  "i": 31,
  "text": "So got her"
 },
 {
  "start": 217.940771,
  "end": 221.012177,
  "sil_before": [
   214.481927,
   217.940771
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   221.012177,
   223.830295
  ],
  "i": 32,
  "text": "This one landed just a few weeks ago, June 30th."
 },
 {
  "start": 223.830295,
  "end": 224.647506,
  "sil_before": [
   221.012177,
   223.830295
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   224.647506,
   225.027256
  ],
  "i": 33,
  "text": "and this fork."
 },
 {
  "start": 225.027256,
  "end": 226.463673,
  "sil_before": [
   224.647506,
   225.027256
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   226.463673,
   226.813401
  ],
  "i": 34,
  "text": "was not about speed at all."
 },
 {
  "start": 226.813401,
  "end": 228.270522,
  "sil_before": [
   226.463673,
   226.813401
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   228.270522,
   231.391746
  ],
  "i": 35,
  "text": "It's the programmability fork."
 },
 {
  "start": 231.391746,
  "end": 234.819796,
  "sil_before": [
   228.270522,
   231.391746
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   234.819796,
   235.45644
  ],
  "i": 36,
  "text": "Programmable spending rules, escrow, volts, time locks."
 },
 {
  "start": 235.45644,
  "end": 237.191973,
  "sil_before": [
   234.819796,
   235.45644
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   237.191973,
   238.924558
  ],
  "i": 37,
  "text": "Native tokens on the base layer."
 },
 {
  "start": 238.924558,
  "end": 241.176145,
  "sil_before": [
   237.191973,
   238.924558
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   241.176145,
   241.503084
  ],
  "i": 38,
  "text": "and even verifying zero-knowledge proofs."
 },
 {
  "start": 241.503084,
  "end": 242.381769,
  "sil_before": [
   241.176145,
   241.503084
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   242.381769,
   250.192993
  ],
  "i": 39,
  "text": "right on chain."
 },
 {
  "start": 250.192993,
  "end": 253.275011,
  "sil_before": [
   242.381769,
   250.192993
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   253.275011,
   253.694399
  ],
  "i": 40,
  "text": "So notice what Tokata did not touch, a block right."
 },
 {
  "start": 253.694399,
  "end": 256.404195,
  "sil_before": [
   253.275011,
   253.694399
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   256.404195,
   269.58161
  ],
  "i": 41,
  "text": "Today, Casper still runs at 10 blocks a second."
 },
 {
  "start": 269.58161,
  "end": 272.788299,
  "sil_before": [
   256.404195,
   269.58161
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   272.788299,
   274.370408
  ],
  "i": 42,
  "text": "Which brings us to the second hard fork of 2026."
 },
 {
  "start": 274.370408,
  "end": 276.590068,
  "sil_before": [
   272.788299,
   274.370408
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   276.590068,
   279.551995
  ],
  "i": 43,
  "text": "Two hard forks in a single year."
 },
 {
  "start": 283.114331,
  "end": 284.11873,
  "sil_before": [
   280.295488,
   283.114331
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   284.11873,
   284.819932
  ],
  "i": 44,
  "text": "This second one."
 },
 {
  "start": 284.819932,
  "end": 285.827302,
  "sil_before": [
   284.11873,
   284.819932
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   285.827302,
   286.15127
  ],
  "i": 45,
  "text": "is the Speed Fort."
 },
 {
  "start": 286.15127,
  "end": 287.47059,
  "sil_before": [
   285.827302,
   286.15127
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   287.47059,
   288.029456
  ],
  "i": 46,
  "text": "From 10 blocks a second."
 },
 {
  "start": 288.029456,
  "end": 288.866009,
  "sil_before": [
   287.47059,
   288.029456
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   288.866009,
   289.27551
  ],
  "i": 47,
  "text": "So up to 40."
 },
 {
  "start": 289.27551,
  "end": 290.273832,
  "sil_before": [
   288.866009,
   289.27551
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   290.273832,
   292.589388
  ],
  "i": 48,
  "text": "four times the speed."
 },
 {
  "start": 292.589388,
  "end": 294.375034,
  "sil_before": [
   290.273832,
   292.589388
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   294.375034,
   304.539683
  ],
  "i": 49,
  "text": "And that's targeted before this year is out."
 },
 {
  "start": 304.539683,
  "end": 308.286531,
  "sil_before": [
   294.375034,
   304.539683
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   308.286531,
   308.851791
  ],
  "i": 50,
  "text": "And in my opinion, I think it has a really cool name this time."
 },
 {
  "start": 308.851791,
  "end": 309.512585,
  "sil_before": [
   308.286531,
   308.851791
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   309.512585,
   331.346213
  ],
  "i": 51,
  "text": "Diagnite."
 },
 {
  "start": 331.346213,
  "end": 332.539796,
  "sil_before": [
   309.512585,
   331.346213
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   332.539796,
   333.574853
  ],
  "i": 52,
  "text": "It's like Dark Knight."
 },
 {
  "start": 333.574853,
  "end": 341.69551,
  "sil_before": [
   332.539796,
   333.574853
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   341.69551,
   352.545828
  ],
  "i": 53,
  "text": "But it does a good job of honing in on exactly what it is and what it is not. It's not a chain. It's a DAG. It's a directed acyclic graph."
 },
 {
  "start": 352.545828,
  "end": 354.054286,
  "sil_before": [
   341.69551,
   352.545828
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   354.054286,
   355.297438
  ],
  "i": 54,
  "text": "I look at the top of this ladder."
 },
 {
  "start": 355.297438,
  "end": 358.683333,
  "sil_before": [
   354.054286,
   355.297438
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   358.683333,
   361.124649
  ],
  "i": 55,
  "text": "There's one more rung up there, and it says 100."
 },
 {
  "start": 361.124649,
  "end": 362.684014,
  "sil_before": [
   358.683333,
   361.124649
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   362.684014,
   365.441633
  ],
  "i": 56,
  "text": "100 blocks a second."
 },
 {
  "start": 365.441633,
  "end": 367.360544,
  "sil_before": [
   362.684014,
   365.441633
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   367.360544,
   377.883492
  ],
  "i": 57,
  "text": "That's the 2027 target."
 },
 {
  "start": 377.883492,
  "end": 382.113356,
  "sil_before": [
   367.360544,
   377.883492
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   382.113356,
   390.162041
  ],
  "i": 58,
  "text": "But that hard fork will only exist if Dag Knight lands first."
 },
 {
  "start": 390.162041,
  "end": 392.727664,
  "sil_before": [
   382.113356,
   390.162041
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   392.727664,
   393.630272
  ],
  "i": 59,
  "text": "So what actually is Dagnyte?"
 },
 {
  "start": 393.630272,
  "end": 395.413084,
  "sil_before": [
   392.727664,
   393.630272
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   395.413084,
   396.558299
  ],
  "i": 60,
  "text": "It's a new consensus protocol."
 },
 {
  "start": 396.558299,
  "end": 400.415488,
  "sil_before": [
   395.413084,
   396.558299
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   400.415488,
   401.389478
  ],
  "i": 61,
  "text": "the rule book every node uses to agree on the order of blocks."
 },
 {
  "start": 401.389478,
  "end": 403.463991,
  "sil_before": [
   400.415488,
   401.389478
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   403.463991,
   404.048503
  ],
  "i": 62,
  "text": "It comes from Casper's own researchers."
 },
 {
  "start": 404.048503,
  "end": 406.457846,
  "sil_before": [
   403.463991,
   404.048503
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   406.457846,
   407.028639
  ],
  "i": 63,
  "text": "Jodenton Sampalinski and Michael Sutton."
 },
 {
  "start": 407.028639,
  "end": 408.654739,
  "sil_before": [
   406.457846,
   407.028639
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   408.654739,
   416.487596
  ],
  "i": 64,
  "text": "and a paper from 2022."
 },
 {
  "start": 416.487596,
  "end": 421.565601,
  "sil_before": [
   408.654739,
   416.487596
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   421.565601,
   425.776168
  ],
  "i": 65,
  "text": "And it replaces the protocol that Casper runs today, which is called Ghost Dag."
 },
 {
  "start": 425.776168,
  "end": 428.18737,
  "sil_before": [
   421.565601,
   425.776168
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   428.18737,
   429.127914
  ],
  "i": 66,
  "text": "Now don't get me wrong, Ghost Dag is brilliant."
 },
 {
  "start": 429.127914,
  "end": 431.925442,
  "sil_before": [
   428.18737,
   429.127914
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   431.925442,
   434.139524
  ],
  "i": 67,
  "text": "but it has this one built in cost."
 },
 {
  "start": 434.139524,
  "end": 435.014467,
  "sil_before": [
   431.925442,
   434.139524
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   435.014467,
   435.371565
  ],
  "i": 68,
  "text": "There's a number."
 },
 {
  "start": 435.371565,
  "end": 436.535896,
  "sil_before": [
   435.014467,
   435.371565
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   436.535896,
   443.606349
  ],
  "i": 69,
  "text": "hard-coded into it."
 },
 {
  "start": 443.606349,
  "end": 449.171451,
  "sil_before": [
   436.535896,
   443.606349
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   449.171451,
   450.09161
  ],
  "i": 70,
  "text": "A worst case guess. A guess about how slow the internet between two nodes ever gets."
 },
 {
  "start": 450.09161,
  "end": 454.566281,
  "sil_before": [
   449.171451,
   450.09161
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   454.566281,
   456.399342
  ],
  "i": 71,
  "text": "And to stay safe, the whole network has to run as slow as that guess."
 },
 {
  "start": 456.399342,
  "end": 462.225034,
  "sil_before": [
   454.566281,
   456.399342
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   462.225034,
   462.7139
  ],
  "i": 72,
  "text": "It's like a highway where the speed limit is set for the worst storm of the year and it never changes."
 },
 {
  "start": 462.7139,
  "end": 463.517687,
  "sil_before": [
